<title>MEXICO: Duff &amp; Phelps gives MAA- to Vitro pagare issue.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps gives MAA- to Vitro pagare issue.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit rating agency Duff &amp; Phelps de Mexico has given a rating of MAA- to the 510 million pesos worth of pagares issued by glass producer Vitro S.A..</p>
<p>&quot;Duff &amp; Phelps has given a rating a MAA- (double A minus) to Vitro for its issue of medium-term pagares worth a total of 510 million pesos, which will be used to restructure short-term debt,&quot; the rating agency said in a release.</p>
<p>--Daniel Perez-Whitaker, Monterrey (528) 3457617</p>
</text>
